**Given:**

47 + {7 + [61 − (21 ÷ 3)] ÷ 9}

**Concept Used:**

Follow the BODMAS rule according to the table given below:

 [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/649ec7e18aa0c53ea5d7f4573bdf897b790d7ec7a5809de88d09de57afb672df.png] 

**Calculation:**

47 + {7 + [61 − __**(21 ÷ 3)**__] ÷ 9}

= 47 + {7 + __**[61 − 7]**__ ÷ 9}

= 47 + {7 + __**54 ÷ 9**__}

= 47 + __**{7 + 6}**__ 

= 47 + 13 

= 60

Hence, the required value is **60.**
